====== ZyXEL GS1900-10HP ======
The ZyXEL GS1900-10HP is an 8 port gigabit <abbr title="Power over Ethernet">PoE+</abbr> switch with 2 additional SFP gigabit uplinks. It supports 802.3af and 802.3at with a [[https://www.zyxel.com/global/en/products/switch/8-10-16-24-48-port-gbe-smart-managed-switch-gs1900-series/specification|total PoE budget of 77W]].

